---
import type { NationalRankings } from '../data/schema';
import { pageI18n } from '../i18n/page';

interface Props {
  data: NationalRankings;
}

const { data } = Astro.props;
const { t, fmt, country, provider: providerName } = pageI18n(Astro.url);
const { number } = fmt;
const leaders = data.consensus;
const countryLabel = country(data.country);
---

<section class="national-spotlight surface" aria-label={t(`${data.country} spotlight`, `${countryLabel}聚焦`)}>
  <header class="national-head">
    <div>
      <p class="mono">{countryLabel}</p>
      <h3>{t('How the two largest publisher rankings place U.S. universities.', '两大发布方排名如何为美国大学排位。')}</h3>
    </div>
    <ul class="national-legend">
      {data.providers.map((provider) => (
        <li>
          <strong>{providerName(provider.provider, provider.providerLabel)}</strong>
          <span>{t(`${number.format(provider.totalRanked)} U.S. listed · ${provider.year}`, `${number.format(provider.totalRanked)} 所美国院校上榜 · ${provider.year}`)}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </header>

  <ol class="national-board">
    {leaders.map((institution, index) => (
      <li>
        <span class="rank mono">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
        <span class="identity">
          <strong>{institution.name}</strong>
          <span class="chips">
            {institution.ranks.map((rank) => (
              <b class="chip">{providerName(rank.provider, rank.providerLabel)} #{rank.rankDisplay}</b>
            ))}
          </span>
        </span>
        <span class="mean" title={t("Mean of both providers' rank positions", '两家排名名次的平均值')}>
          <small>{t('Mean', '平均')}</small>
          <b class="mono">{institution.meanRank}</b>
        </span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <p class="fine-print">
    {t(
      `Ranks are each provider’s global position restricted to U.S. institutions; the order combines the two into a mean rank across the ${data.consensus.length} universities both rankings list near the top. It is a focused national lens built from the collected U.S. tables, not a separate methodology.`,
      `名次为各家排名在美国院校范围内的全球位置；排序将两者合并为平均名次，涵盖两家排名都列于前列的 ${data.consensus.length} 所大学。这是基于所收集的美国榜单构建的国别视角，并非一套独立的方法。`,
    )}
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .national-spotlight {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .national-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .national-head .mono {
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
  }
  .national-head h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
    max-width: 32ch;
  }
  .national-legend {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .national-legend li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .national-legend strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .national-legend span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  .national-board {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .national-board li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.25rem 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2, transparent);
  }
  .national-board .rank {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .identity {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .identity strong {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    min-width: 0;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .chip {
    max-width: 100%;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.55rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .mean {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.1rem;
  }
  .mean small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .mean b {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .national-board li {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
    }
    .mean {
      grid-column: 2;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
